<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 28px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Join us in Birmingham in 3 weeks!</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Join us at our <strong>International Insights Summit</strong>, a unique event dedicated to empowering UK higher education institutions to build a more resilient and globally competitive future for UK universities.&nbsp;</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Date: <strong>25th November 2025</strong> (with optional pre-event dinner on 24th November)</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Time: <strong>9.30am - 4pm</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Venue: <strong>The Grand Hotel Birmingham</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">You’ll hear the actionable insights from your peers and leaders in the HE sector, and we'll dive deep into our global payment data, unlocking actionable insights for your recruitment, admissions, and finance teams. We'll also be revealing the <strong>insights from our most recent Admissions Navigator research</strong>&nbsp;into university international admissions process capabilities.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
