<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 16px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Join our training led by Joanna Brewin, Consultant, Flywire, aimed at those responsible for AML. The course will introduce fraud and money laundering concepts; consider the legal position as it applies to the sector; summarise the known activity in the sector; provide guidance to help assess and mitigate risk; outline frameworks to identify and analyse suspicious activity; and provide reporting guidance both internally and to the National Crime Agency. </span></p> </td> 
