<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-right: 20px; padding-bottom: 16px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Join our online QSA drop in call led by Dave Neild, Head of Consultancy UK, Flywire. This meeting presents an opportunity to ask our Qualified Security Assessors (QSAs) questions in an informal setting. It occurs every third Wednesday of the month, from 12:30PM - 1:30PM.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">Other dates: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.addevent.com/event/Yj26539658?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;mkt_tok=MzcyLVFTUS02NDkAAAGciVaJmQZRsuU6_q7JOkABPGiK19OCS2ADtZ2EjxAcf9fSO2vQIKB7xK3OIGO9gojQxPZc6V6AHOVRaCM_Gsc&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=monthlyroundup"><span style="color: #48b985;"><u>17th Dec</u></span></a></span></p> </td> 
