<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 28px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Webinar Replay</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><strong>Fraud Prevention in Higher Education: New Tools for the Sector</strong></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">The replay of our recent webinar held on October 21st is available to watch.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">This webinar, led by Flywire Consultants Jo Brewin and Bridget Walker, introduced a new, complimentary suite of resources designed to <strong>help universities protect themselves </strong>and <strong>their international students</strong> from <strong>fraud </strong>and<strong> money laundering. </strong></span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">The session showcased Flywire's <strong>newly developed fraud prevention toolkit </strong>and a</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">&nbsp;<strong>compelling new video series</strong> created in collaboration with <strong>We Fight Fraud.&nbsp;</strong></span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
